{"type":"standard","title":"Todd Achilles","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Todd Achilles</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q125791858","titles":{"canonical":"Todd_Achilles","normalized":"Todd Achilles","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Todd Achilles</span></span>"},"pageid":76378195,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/dd/Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png/330px-Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":446},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/dd/Todd_Achilles_on_LibertyDad%27s_stream.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":673,"height":909},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375573275","tid":"8f8156ab-b380-11f1-81cf-21a7ca4fdb25","timestamp":"2026-09-18T16:46:57Z","description":"American politician","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Todd_Achilles"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Todd_Achilles","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Todd_Achilles?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Todd_Achilles"}},"extract":"Theodore B. \"Todd\" Achilles is an American politician and U.S. Army veteran. He served as a member for the 16B district of the Idaho House of Representatives from 2024 to 2025. He is the co-founder of Veterans for Idaho Voters. He is a professor of public policy at Boise State University.","extract_html":"<p><b>Theodore B. \"Todd\" Achilles</b> is an American politician and U.S. Army veteran. He served as a member for the 16B district of the Idaho House of Representatives from 2024 to 2025. He is the co-founder of Veterans for Idaho Voters. He is a professor of public policy at Boise State University.</p>"}